y \'Absolutely\' and I’ll send the information right away.  \r\n\r\nI’m looking forward to your response!','2026-04-06 09:08:53'),(1140,285,18057,1,'DavididopsDS DavididopsDS','2026-04-11 20:37:12'),(1141,285,18057,2,'no.reply.gerardlaurent@gmail.com','2026-04-11 20:37:12'),(1142,285,18057,3,'A bold new strategy for advertising.','2026-04-11 20:37:12'),(1143,285,18057,4,'Greetings! printingcomics.com, \r\nWhile browsing web pages I noticed your website. \r\nWe offer a solution that helps companies reach websites worldwide. \r\nMany companies now use online outreach to reach website owners across different industries. \r\nOur pricing structure is designed to remain transparent. \r\nIf you are interested, you can take a look at the platform. \r\nYou can contact us if this approach is relevant for you. \r\n \r\nThanks for taking a moment to read this. \r\nContact us. \r\nTelegram - https://t.me/FeedbackFormEU \r\nWhatsApp - +375259112693 \r\nWhatsApp  https://wa.me/+375259112693','2026-04-11 20:37:12'),(1144,286,18057,1,'Gabrielle SimmonsGabrielle Simmons','2026-04-15 20:08:45'),(1145,286,18057,2,'gabrielle.simmons@jmailservice.com','2026-04-15 20:08:45'),(1146,286,18057,3,'Turn Searchers Into Customers','2026-04-15 20:08:45'),(1147,286,18057,4,'When someone searches for your service, you should be the first thing they see.\r\n\r\nWe make that happen.\r\n\r\nNo long learning curve. No complicated campaigns. Just targeted search traffic based on the keywords you choose.\r\n\r\nInterested?\r\n\r\nSend your website and keyword list, and I\'ll send you guaranteed traffic numbers along with pricing options.\r\n\r\nLet\'s put you in front of ready buyers.','2026-04-15 20:08:45'),(1148,287,18057,1,'Krysteline Williams','2026-04-16 10:36:52'),(1149,287,18057,2,'krystelinwilliams@gmail.com','2026-04-16 10:36:52'),(1150,287,18057,3,'Just offering ideas, whether you use them or not.','2026-04-16 10:36:52'),(1151,287,18057,4,'Really impressed with your site design!\r\nBut it’s not